  "note": "Issue 96 adds source-unit-keyed title/body-opening decisions for Volume 7 ordinals 9485-11424 through additive profile v10, preserving every v9 decision unchanged. It advances the honorific formula registry to v1.8.0 with 57 reviewed exact Volume 7 source forms while keeping non-formula Arabic and translation defects outside the registry. Packet-schema document v9 pins registry 1.8.0 to this v11 binding. Packet, shard, tool and stage-provenance data remain version 3.0.0; public-proposal v2, execution registry v2 and sol-xhigh-explicit-host-v1 remain unchanged. Earlier bindings, title profiles, schemas, proposals, releases and evidence retain their original immutable pins."
